WEBVTT

00:01:26.652 --> 00:01:30.984
"Do you believe that stress
is harmful for your health?"

00:01:32.430 --> 00:01:35.986
And then they used public death records
to find out who died.

00:01:36.010 --> 00:01:37.191
(Laughter)

00:01:37.215 --> 00:01:39.013
Okay.

00:01:39.037 --> 00:01:41.187
Some bad news first.

00:01:41.211 --> 00:01:44.612
People who experienced a lot of stress
in the previous year

00:01:44.636 --> 00:01:47.389
had a 43 percent increased risk of dying.

00:01:48.612 --> 00:01:52.371
But that was only true for the people

00:01:52.395 --> 00:01:56.032
who also believed that stress
is harmful for your health.

00:01:56.056 --> 00:01:58.816
(Laughter)

00:01:58.840 --> 00:02:01.116
People who experienced a lot of stress